    "body": "currently in Gecko we use webidl to store the callbacks\r\nhttps://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/webidl/WebComponents.webidl#22\r\n\r\nWebIDL dictionaries are always handled in an expected order, not somewhat random.",
