    "created_at": "2018-03-27T07:37:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-27T07:37:37Z",
    "body": "Yeah, it seems like it's worth normalizing the retrieval order & `null` treatment to be consistent with dictionary case. I don't think there is much benefit in being different in this case. In general, we should try to reduce the platform quirks & inconsistencies like this as much as possible.",
